    "answer": {
      "short": "$r=3$",
      "worked": "$$\\frac{8!}{(8-r)!}=336$$\nBy guess and check:\n$$\\begin{aligned}{}^8P_1&=8\\\\{}^8P_2&=8\\times7=56\\\\{}^8P_3&=8\\times7\\times6=336\\end{aligned}$$\nTherefore, $r=3$.",
